            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Edit an event.</strong> Click an event, then Edit, to change its title, location or description. Return saves, Escape cancels, and Undo puts it back.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Updates install right away.</strong> Chora checks every hour and now installs a new version as soon as it has downloaded, relaunching in a few seconds, instead of waiting for you to quit.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
